    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slay All Evil, Spare None!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/387aee7057feb7b6bd0564a61d736079.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/387aee7057feb7b6bd0564a61d736079.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/387aee7057feb7b6bd0564a61d736079.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Polished to Perfection\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Frame-perfect animations with realistic attack recovery.  <br>\u25b6 Dodge cancels flow smoothly, input response is precise.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/ef3e4cb6db48922a650213054df9e955.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/ef3e4cb6db48922a650213054df9e955.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/ef3e4cb6db48922a650213054df9e955.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Symphony of Carnage</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Face shieldmen phalanxes, berserker Blade Five, hammer-wielding Dun Zhi, charging Shark Prison, and twin specters... Every fight demands mastery of space and timing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/950c6a7c71bd4a290bd6ac27f1b79dcd.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/950c6a7c71bd4a290bd6ac27f1b79dcd.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/950c6a7c71bd4a290bd6ac27f1b79dcd.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blade as Art</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain 26 skills through light/heavy attacks:  <br>\u25b6 Dash-dodge seamlessly into offense.  <br>\u25b6 &quot;Dragonfly Skim&quot; (aerial combo), &quot;Cloud Clamp&quot; (crowd control), &quot;Triple Sweep&quot; (leg breaker), &quot;Black Shear&quot; (crushing blow).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/7a871ae18c063ad7413dfd526d9c9bd6.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/7a871ae18c063ad7413dfd526d9c9bd6.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/7a871ae18c063ad7413dfd526d9c9bd6.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry Aesthetics</strong>: Deflect arrows to kill archers instantly, clash blades for 3x damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Godspeed Flow</strong>: Chain dodges after &quot;Mystic Leap&quot; to maintain sprint state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragonfly Skim</strong>: Infinite aerial rebounds by hitting targets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty &amp; Flow</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Modes</strong>  <br>\u25b6 Wanderer: Slower enemies for beginners.  <br>\u25b6 Demon Slayer: True designer's vision.  <br>\u25b6 Formless: Double enemy density, hardcore only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-Sized Fury</strong>  <br>\u25b6 2-hour linear campaign, no puzzles or grind \u2014 pure blade mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Art &amp; Mood</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monochrome landscapes pierced by cold steel glows, &quot;ink blood&quot; splatters, and fading afterimages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses manifest as corrupted generals, twin blade phantoms \u2014 oriental dread reimagined.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slay All Evil, Spare None!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/387aee7057feb7b6bd0564a61d736079.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/387aee7057feb7b6bd0564a61d736079.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/387aee7057feb7b6bd0564a61d736079.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Polished to Perfection\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Frame-perfect animations with realistic attack recovery.  <br>\u25b6 Dodge cancels flow smoothly, input response is precise.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/ef3e4cb6db48922a650213054df9e955.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/ef3e4cb6db48922a650213054df9e955.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/ef3e4cb6db48922a650213054df9e955.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Symphony of Carnage</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b6 Face shieldmen phalanxes, berserker Blade Five, hammer-wielding Dun Zhi, charging Shark Prison, and twin specters... Every fight demands mastery of space and timing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/950c6a7c71bd4a290bd6ac27f1b79dcd.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/950c6a7c71bd4a290bd6ac27f1b79dcd.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/950c6a7c71bd4a290bd6ac27f1b79dcd.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blade as Art</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain 26 skills through light/heavy attacks:  <br>\u25b6 Dash-dodge seamlessly into offense.  <br>\u25b6 &quot;Dragonfly Skim&quot; (aerial combo), &quot;Cloud Clamp&quot; (crowd control), &quot;Triple Sweep&quot; (leg breaker), &quot;Black Shear&quot; (crushing blow).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/7a871ae18c063ad7413dfd526d9c9bd6.poster.avif?t=1750380474\" width=616 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/7a871ae18c063ad7413dfd526d9c9bd6.webm?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633500/extras/7a871ae18c063ad7413dfd526d9c9bd6.mp4?t=1750380474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry Aesthetics</strong>: Deflect arrows to kill archers instantly, clash blades for 3x damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Godspeed Flow</strong>: Chain dodges after &quot;Mystic Leap&quot; to maintain sprint state.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragonfly Skim</strong>: Infinite aerial rebounds by hitting targets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty &amp; Flow</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Modes</strong>  <br>\u25b6 Wanderer: Slower enemies for beginners.  <br>\u25b6 Demon Slayer: True designer's vision.  <br>\u25b6 Formless: Double enemy density, hardcore only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-Sized Fury</strong>  <br>\u25b6 2-hour linear campaign, no puzzles or grind \u2014 pure blade mastery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Art &amp; Mood</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monochrome landscapes pierced by cold steel glows, &quot;ink blood&quot; splatters, and fading afterimages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses manifest as corrupted generals, twin blade phantoms \u2014 oriental dread reimagined.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
